  "question": {
    "text": "A ball is thrown up with a certain velocity so that it reaches a height <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>h</mi><mo>.</mo></math> Find the ratio of the two different times of the ball reaching <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>h</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math> in both the directions."
  },
